[en.FOCUS_C18_001_DOLE]
National Dole

[en.FOCUS_C18_001_DOLE_desc]
Raise national minimum wage levels, and provide dole payments to the unemployed, ensuring that every Kirin can obtain basic living security.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_001_DOLE]
全民救济

[zh.FOCUS_C18_001_DOLE_desc]
提高全民最低工资水平，并提供失业救济金，确保每只麒麟都能获得基本的生活保障。

